# My Static Website Docker Image

This is a simple static HTML website (from lab from the first semester) served using nginx.

## Description

The project contains a static website and a Dockerfile that builds
an nginx-based container to serve the site.

The image was created as part of the DevOps with Docker course.

## How to build the image

Clone the repository and run:

docker build -t my-static-site .

## How to run the container

docker run -p 8080:80 my-static-site

Then open your browser at:

http://localhost:8080

## Docker Hub

docker pull yourdockerhubname/my-static-site
docker run -p 8080:80 yourdockerhubname/my-static-site
## Base Image

nginx:alpine

